{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_101_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_101_title", "source_sha256": "9304100e380e71f54ffa0a8dd1ed4cb78f40117760e2ee1bd1c0ef7e6fb3fe1f", "ja": "あふれる欠片を抱きしめて", "zh": "紧紧拥抱满溢的碎片", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_101_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_101_synopsis", "source_sha256": "53f47572fa1309246cbd3b94d3a994d25d83b5a4f5f38b007ead1a53c1f7fb21", "ja": "仕事の失敗を気に病むエミリー。そんな中、\n子ども達にアイドルの仕事を教える事に。\n自身が経験した厳しさを伝えるべきか悩む\nエミリーだったが、自身を客観的に見るため\n真剣な思いを伝えるため、新曲を披露する。", "zh": "艾米莉因工作上的失误而郁郁寡欢。就在这时，\n她接下了教孩子们偶像工作的差事。\n艾米莉很苦恼是否该向孩子们诉说自己经历过的严苛，\n但为了能够客观地审视自身，\n为了传达出自己真挚的想法，她展现了新歌。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_101_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_101_1000_p", "source_sha256": "4134ae656dacb637529038e9c87838c50cb36e777246875c9baaf5ba64d187b8", "ja": "（今日は『小学生デイズ！』1回目の収録だ。事前に\nもらった質問内容で、予行演習をしておいたけど……）", "zh": "（今天是《小学生时光！》第1次录制。虽然已经根据事先拿到的问题内容做过预演了，可是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_101_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_101_1001_shikaisya", "source_sha256": "b2251aafa64871db38168cc7c921a8f82bbef1297fb5a63fd4eaa9f78f23f110", "ja": "今日は、スペシャルな先生のスペシャル授業だよ！\nそれでは先生のみなさん、どうぞ～！", "zh": "今天是特别老师的特别课程哦！\n那么，各位老师，请开始吧～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_101_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_101_1002_030iku", "source_sha256": "202dabda64f9adb396dbf643ddd4f657eeb2ddbe62e5f0e55b634bb7ee70524a", "ja": "みんな、こんにちはー！　今日は、わたしたちが、\nアイドルのお仕事についてお話をします！", "zh": "大家好——！今天由我们来给大家讲讲偶像的工作！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_101_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_101_1003_kodomotati", "source_sha256": "de1a380cce85f654afb4796e1b5d9797f878744f41677ec3fe12ee86cbf5f667", "ja": "はーーーい！！", "zh": "好～～～！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_101_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_101_1004_005yay", "source_sha256": "83908e278fad8a7baf7cdf0d9053118055f1af85517168e9d63af85b648c405f", "ja": "みんな、元気いっぱいですー！\n私達も、みんなに負けないよう、がんばりまーす！", "zh": "大家都精神饱满的——！\n我们也会加油，不输给大家——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_101_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_101_1005_041fuk", "source_sha256": "82e3c68a84d45c830e26efd76ee0a8de1fa84c89f89c195b027cbb70e6b754b6", "ja": "それじゃ、まずは私たちからみんなに質問です。\nみんなは、『アイドル』を見たことがありますか？", "zh": "那么，首先由我们来问大家一个问题。\n大家见过“偶像”吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_101_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_101_1006_onnanoko1", "source_sha256": "103863b50cc0278a002ffc892226fb3a1a38d4fb0b8bddd06952c4cd78ee7733", "ja": "はい！　わたし、やよいさん見たことあります！\nステージで歌ってるとこ♪", "zh": "是的！我见过弥生小姐！\n见过她在舞台上唱歌的样子♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_101_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_101_1007_onnanoko2", "source_sha256": "1b45f1fbf51dbf876d93610e6328c68f39b53b3ebe55aaddbe528942060ae384", "ja": "765プロの人たちって、ドラマとかにも出てるよね！\nあとは、バラエティ番組とかでも、見たかも？", "zh": "765事务所的大家，也有出演电视剧之类的呢！\n还有，好像也在综艺节目里看到过？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_101_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_101_1008_041fuk", "source_sha256": "d3797bafdfc4516f809c5c2f5e917d1dc6710d16447d4b11ad767965c3383807", "ja": "わぁ♪　みんな私たちのこと、とっても\nよく知ってくれてるんだね。ありがとう！", "zh": "哇♪ 大家都非常了解我们呢。谢谢你们！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_101_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_101_1009_032emi", "source_sha256": "d8c91da7c3f325cf96ed672cda977dc880eb49b7c5c74e02cba93dea576b5e71", "ja": "そうですね。私たち大和撫子の活動は、\n歌や踊りやお芝居など、多種多様です。", "zh": "是啊。我们大和抚子的活动形式多种多样，有唱歌、跳舞和演戏等。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_101_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_101_1010_032emi", "source_sha256": "a318dc95e83e033f2ec4b383eaf0ba7c1f0a5ddf66168a4e038f3d6111f80602", "ja": "私たち大和撫子の活動は、たくさんの\nごヒイキ様方に舞台を応援していただいて……。", "zh": "我们大和撫子的活动，承蒙众多贵客对舞台的支持与厚爱……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_101_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_101_1011_otokonoko1", "source_sha256": "adc4855d81b9594d6aaa17c202a26ddefd1735328eb364f4129461c10dcd8da6", "ja": "えっと……\n『やまとなでしこ』って、なに？", "zh": "那个……\n“日本淑女”是什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_101_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_101_1012_otokonoko2", "source_sha256": "41357caa58effca0b081879f87eab643b2a605baa549f10ce67c36c1438addd4", "ja": "ぼくも、質問！\nエミリーさん、『ごひいきさま』って？", "zh": "我也有问题！艾米莉，“贵客”是什么意思？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_101_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_101_1013_032emi", "source_sha256": "c31e8a1977bb0caaf5bc78cca683e0d3106c560d7df28c4e568e71c3106dbfb0", "ja": "は、はい！\nそれにつきましては、紗代子さん、お願いします。", "zh": "啊、好的！\n关于这个问题，就拜托纱代子小姐了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_101_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_101_1014_027say", "source_sha256": "43bd1f75f57aa3d6e488cafc2348f5fe6e05a6b5b13e1393e08a15301c3be882", "ja": "それじゃあみんな、こっちのテロップを見てください！\n大和撫子は、昔からある言葉なんだけど……。", "zh": "那么，大家请看这边的字幕！\n“大和抚子”是个由来已久的说法，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_101_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_101_1015_027say", "source_sha256": "ea8d61fdb695f4df572b8c232c26221bbec7bf81add1a4d6ded5bd5f24125e73", "ja": "エミリーちゃんのいう『大和撫子』は、\n『とってもステキなアイドル』……って意味だよ！", "zh": "艾米莉所说的“大和抚子”，意思就是“非常棒的偶像”哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_101_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_101_1016_otokonokotachi", "source_sha256": "d16a1d7b313b45b6f9216b01f572424b987acc8b435d667c5413ce88f2215b54", "ja": "ふーん……？", "zh": "是喔……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_101_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_101_1017_p", "source_sha256": "d33066d49451ddec97347237cd2bc8410075acf89b51bd7b09ff4a8b19a5fff3", "ja": "（エミリーの独特な言葉も、アイドルの個性のうちだ。\nだから、予めテロップを用意しておいたけど……）", "zh": "（艾米莉那独特的说话方式，也是偶像个性的一部分。所以我提前准备了字幕，不过……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_101_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_101_1018_p", "source_sha256": "58c8dc52db203c432e07d53385bad47bd5bc795ba90b52fab72a4743453dfc7b", "ja": "（子ども達には、少し難しかっただろうか……）", "zh": "（对孩子们来说，可能有点难理解吧……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_101_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_101_1020_032emi", "source_sha256": "24d55e69f212f24516c4af9969e1b70527e24f5495fbbe9c376de3b121981b30", "ja": "ということで……\nみなさん、何か質問はありますか？", "zh": "所以……\n大家有什么问题吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
