{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_101_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_101_1035_030iku", "source_sha256": "f8eee05e9eaf4da1e70e78e26ec7b4df24e236566802fe1ee196d00229b85cd3", "ja": "うん！\nさくらちゃんは、レッスン楽しくない？", "zh": "嗯！\n小樱，你不觉得练习很开心吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_101_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_101_1036_sakura", "source_sha256": "6f2729f1958406bf2a0cb228ec008bbe24c31bafa0959a9fd762336fe76b5db0", "ja": "あんまり……。\nできないことが、いっぱいあるし……。", "zh": "不太行……  \n因为有很多做不到的事情……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_101_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_101_1037_sakura", "source_sha256": "8551ca0fa74311ad6c2d0c3299f3a7ea9f5236b803700a379aa34434ddbf295b", "ja": "あとは、先生の前でおどるテストとか、\nきんちょうして失敗しちゃう……。", "zh": "还有在老师面前跳舞的测试之类的，\n一紧张就会失败……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_101_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_101_1038_027say", "source_sha256": "fba82fef947398b3b562050e96a2d1cc21dfc54ccc9b57647d784366d108019d", "ja": "そっか。できない自分に悲しくなったり、\n悔しくなったりすることが、あると思うけど……。", "zh": "这样啊。我想，你也会有因为自己做不到而难过，或是感到不甘心的时候……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_101_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_101_1039_027say", "source_sha256": "3771355fe0f5837e128f686eca97da16febf1b265c955b2955472b189cc5fb0b", "ja": "でも、練習した分だけ自信に繋がると思うよ。\nだから、諦めずにがんばろう！", "zh": "但是，我觉得每一次练习都会化作自信。\n所以，不要放弃，一起加油吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_101_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_101_1040_005yay", "source_sha256": "e3505fbaf5738604e1425538e322235efd24418ccefbf2610935f7921d9c746d", "ja": "私たちも、応援してるからね！", "zh": "我们也会为你加油的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_101_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_101_1042_005yay", "source_sha256": "eb53f19d1c2d81bfcdfed1783f0561d326fde0c0509d0a27218bc77358b329ef", "ja": "？　……エミリーちゃん、どうかしたの？", "zh": "咦……艾米莉，你怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_101_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_101_1043_032emi", "source_sha256": "1a3d1408a4ff7a5b7d92b0299d3958329412fff3a045f8095b794aa6caf95754", "ja": "あっ……い、いえ。\nなんでもありません！　……。", "zh": "啊……没、没什么。\n什么事都没有！……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_101_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_101_1044_p", "source_sha256": "5cce123f112e4bce048cb2d8476e3c7eb8e8cf9410ea93c1eb64fea4061a8a68", "ja": "（エミリー、色々引っかかってるみたいだな。\n後半の収録前に、話をしてみるか……）", "zh": "（艾米莉好像对各种事情都有些在意。\n在录制后半部分之前，找她谈谈吧……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_101_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_101_1045_p", "source_sha256": "e31b827b2757d7ac519ef658a85a6eb1147a3aa8240098b93fd7a3520dc60cb4", "ja": "お疲れ様、エミリー。\n温かいお茶を持ってきたから、一緒に飲もうか。", "zh": "辛苦了，艾米莉。  \n我带了热茶，我们一起喝吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_101_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_101_1046_032emi", "source_sha256": "1827eb06df22a177e5976ff8c2e68a966f73e3bcc430bc16d05ae28abe941210", "ja": "仕掛け人さま……。\nあの、私……。", "zh": "制作人……。\n那个，我……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_101_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_101_1047_p", "source_sha256": "9d76f2c800737f19cb865ca770195eaf77558fcc9fda08c038a9a4f2fcb3c664", "ja": "気になってる事があるみたいだな。\n話せる事なら、話してみてくれるか？", "zh": "看来你有件在意的事。\n如果能说的话，就跟我说说吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_101_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_101_1048_032emi", "source_sha256": "a43a49562419df65166ddba23d7a4e76d897371309a6964d10b6e5e02f3957a2", "ja": "ありがとうございます。……私、途中から、\nどうしたらいいかわからなくなってしまって……。", "zh": "谢谢您。……我从中途开始，就不知道该怎么办了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_101_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_101_1049_032emi", "source_sha256": "4cc45e600106ca5df320eaf554973f3913f28d0485dba3c8112a2a2682a3a65d", "ja": "大和撫子は、とても素晴らしいお仕事です。\nけど、大切な場面で失敗をしてしまうこともあります。", "zh": "大和抚子，是一份非常了不起的工作。\n但有时也会在重要的关头犯下失误。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_101_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_101_1050_032emi", "source_sha256": "df395def72ea68700a8127d6d81c14c7c274655a6291a75441c441a391180424", "ja": "……先日の、私のように。", "zh": "……就像前几天的我一样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_101_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_101_1051_p", "source_sha256": "01dfbf0b9b426403d7e3c47d2de07ddc85c0a0a0b965e56d5cc1b02ef261ac69", "ja": "うん。", "zh": "嗯。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_101_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_101_1052_032emi", "source_sha256": "a6a2898221936c3a563e512320f9d45c445c4ee1fee9e2fb37951f73c5388ee1", "ja": "本気で大和撫子を目指している方には、そういうことも\nあると、伝えるべきではないかと思ったのですが……。", "zh": "对于认真以大和抚子为目标的人，我觉得也应该把这种事情告诉她们……可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_101_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_101_1053_032emi", "source_sha256": "98f62457d42f2907be0133401018d0baeaddc7470ae80da86d422fb0166db068", "ja": "私はまだ、立派な大和撫子にはなれていません。\nそんな未熟な私では、語る資格などない気がして……。", "zh": "我还没能成为一名出色的大和抚子。\n像我这样尚且稚嫩的人，总觉得没有资格谈论这些……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_101_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_101_1054_p", "source_sha256": "d71a16f5f5d1a5172b48f09ffd380f3a8814bda1e58f854449a038075bc64e2a", "ja": "エミリーは、成長しているよ。\n今までずっと見てきた俺が、保証する。", "zh": "艾米莉一直在成长。\n一直看着你的我可以保证。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_101_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_101_1055_032emi", "source_sha256": "3f082115c8e12f43bd240849a799ff425cc64fdbd4ce4bae5205e590ce77c043", "ja": "本当に、そうでしょうか？　失敗もしましたし、\nさっきの収録でも、上手く答えられませんでした。", "zh": "真的是这样吗？我也失败过，而且刚才的录音中，也没能好好回答。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_101_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_101_1056_032emi", "source_sha256": "9b420d3c886ef06e6420975fc9946748d6c64ff76f02de94138705c2cd9381bf", "ja": "みなさんのお役に立ちたいと思うのに、\n私はまだまだ未熟で……。", "zh": "我明明很想能帮上大家的忙，\n自己却还远远不够成熟……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_101_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_101_1057_p", "source_sha256": "e96ab6ad3efe7054a850bd9cc30714867b952c6509577e3838f3557a78029892", "ja": "そうか……。エミリーが立派だと思うアイドルは、\n失敗せず、なんでも完璧にこなすイメージなのかな？", "zh": "这样啊……在艾米莉看来，值得尊敬的偶像，是不是都不会失败，什么都能完美做到呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_101_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_101_1058_032emi", "source_sha256": "c8437da922b05a66a006272ae646cc70f57e96453c9e5b620e3abbd8e90368f7", "ja": "はい！", "zh": "好的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_101_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_101_1059_p", "source_sha256": "cb99a8f64722155914e3d39837df9de2f0e954e7294f03e62909f373e74567da", "ja": "なるほど。理想のアイドル像を持つのはいい事だけど、\n今はもう少し、客観的に見る事が必要かもしれないな。", "zh": "原来如此。拥有自己理想中的偶像形象是件好事，不过现在或许需要再客观地看待一下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_101_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_101_1060_032emi", "source_sha256": "5b25edfaa545aa46b63f64f57b89ff641441f551d1eac608d97043c09be3a6ca", "ja": "客観的に……？", "zh": "客观地……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_101_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_101_1061_p", "source_sha256": "648dbda92d58f195f83969301df7419d9ddc1e996feba8971728bcd7c462234a", "ja": "ああ。……なあ、エミリー。ひとつ提案なんだけど、\n子供達の前で新曲を披露してみないか？", "zh": "啊。……那个，艾米莉，我有个提议。\n要不要在孩子们面前表演一下新歌？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_101_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_101_1062_032emi", "source_sha256": "3ec21476ef7e2382fd97db6961982477da9e7b6fd5f5df64ced515132a92aeec", "ja": "新曲を……えっ？\nええっ！　今、ここでですか！？", "zh": "新歌……诶？\n诶——！现在就要在这里唱吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_101_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_101_1063_p", "source_sha256": "5308ed12b7788917a90158de9c9b6109dca5bedd9d58e8f6848ecad235ad9fee", "ja": "そうだ。構成が変わるから、\nスタッフさんに相談しないといけないけど……。", "zh": "没错。因为演出构成会改变，\n得先和工作人员商量一下……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_101_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_101_1064_p", "source_sha256": "a50d9e906b035e1e0a33e90f10c293f76f7503a82e80b0b5e8dfab66f1a5a9ff", "ja": "まずは、エミリーの気持ちを聞かせてほしい。", "zh": "首先，我想听听艾米莉的想法。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_101_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_101_1065_032emi", "source_sha256": "8e7ed25ee7f771a6785c8c620645cad1553bf0ee053dfb087aee99d9ab8fcca8", "ja": "そ、そう言われましても……\nまだお披露目できるような完成度では……。", "zh": "可、可是就算您这么说……\n还没达到可以公开展示的完成度……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_101_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_101_1066_p", "source_sha256": "b3dcb0a03b994cdd92485c622b738eb1e1c656667565170009b6680b49ca077e", "ja": "そうか？　レコーディングは済んでるから、\n歌については問題ないと思ってるよ。", "zh": "这样吗？录音已经完成了，所以我觉得歌曲方面应该没问题。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_101_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_101_1067_p", "source_sha256": "fb5a0476de420e976b7e08846b10c1894be0d2c0634ce55dfcf58241fb023472", "ja": "振り付けも、最後まで入ってるって先生から聞いたし。\n……うん、エミリーならできる！", "zh": "我也听老师说了，编舞已经排练到最后了。\n……嗯，如果是艾米莉，一定能做到！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_101_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_101_1068_032emi", "source_sha256": "b1167e5ab6bf0bf04d69197ee7a70d3e7c63c91d2495270f61236dea6ddf5d7e", "ja": "し、仕掛け人さま！\nでも……もし、また失敗してしまったら……。", "zh": "主、主……！可是……要是又失败了的话……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_101_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_101_1069_p", "source_sha256": "fabead8b89c2db8179ff1a742f0d726f3ae8eaf732d5ca9f0e348ed482b76b42", "ja": "大丈夫だ。\n俺がついてるし、みんなもいる。", "zh": "没事的。\n有我在，大家也都在。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_101_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_101_1070_p", "source_sha256": "4b7c181ac8b2366afd4359abe812c57a9caa2ef28721103ff839bed7197a620a", "ja": "それに、今日は生放送じゃない、収録だ。\n失敗しても、納得できるまで撮り直せばいい。", "zh": "而且，今天不是直播，是录制。\n就算失败了，也可以一直重拍，直到满意为止。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_101_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_101_1071_p", "source_sha256": "bb25453f91da0bc9d990bd5c74cd89904f6bab6363e223c934192e3db2109252", "ja": "エミリーが本気でアイドルに挑む姿を、見てもらう。\n……それが、子供達に伝えられる一番の方法だと思う。", "zh": "让大家看看艾米莉认真挑战偶像的身姿。\n……我觉得这才是传达给孩子们的最好方式。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_101_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_101_1072_032emi", "source_sha256": "802f6ba1c6afef528483fc53f5c672253dcd175dc0ca45581de5cf039ddfd0f7", "ja": "仕掛け人さま……。", "zh": "策划执行人先生……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_101_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_101_1073_032emi", "source_sha256": "e284dbf9f493f4f2ef00ad2a96fca13733445c6923adaf7d166c5caabee42d9a", "ja": "私……上手くできない事もありますけど。\nでもこの歌は、たくさん、たくさん練習しました……。", "zh": "我……有些事情做得不够好。\n但这首歌，我练习了很多很多遍……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_101_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_101_1074_032emi", "source_sha256": "8f77c8149f1fe84231543bb6b379c20296e71db2e633a6cb8f651e8f45623fc8", "ja": "私にとって、大切な曲だから……。", "zh": "因为对我来说，这是首非常重要的歌曲……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_101_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_101_1075_032emi", "source_sha256": "f5feb45ce5d7c406761c3d060929591216383436d4256d2ae7f5a80cc2627747", "ja": "仕掛け人さま。\n私に、歌わせていただけますか？", "zh": "制作人。\n可以让我来唱这首歌吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_101_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_101_1076_p", "source_sha256": "83884c829051170c47bcd9d3837bbafa423acd8c0c912250619b7aebe17a07fc", "ja": "わかった。それじゃ、スタッフさんに相談してくる。\nエミリーは、みんなに説明しておいてくれるか？", "zh": "明白了。那我这就去跟工作人员商量。\n艾米莉，能麻烦你先向大家说明一下吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_101_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_101_1077_032emi", "source_sha256": "715aad2ef968af57b84e51abc0845773b0c842281e29f8a51053b68d9e3ae177", "ja": "はい……！", "zh": "好的……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_101_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_101_1078_p", "source_sha256": "5972020c5fe3ff7c856a79e5686a14ef93fb06edf649e3b366f45fab099258de", "ja": "（番組ディレクターに、エミリーの歌をこの場で\n歌わせてほしいと頼むと、快諾してくれた！）", "zh": "（我拜托节目导演让艾米莉在这里唱歌，没想到他爽快地答应了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_101_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_101_1079_p", "source_sha256": "c82de74dcf6a4d7eac8e727c6fab075bde97b5ace71446d1278658b75c9aaaa0", "ja": "（少しだけ長くなった休憩の後、\nいよいよ、後半部分の収録が始まった……）", "zh": "（稍微延长了一会儿休息后，终于开始录制后半部分了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_101_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_101_1080_shikaisya", "source_sha256": "529190a3505ba7e9f28db238ef04a6b839a9db62758edbdeac55f22efffd9454", "ja": "スペシャルな授業の後半戦、いってみよ～！\nまず最初は、この映像だー♪", "zh": "特别课程的下半场，开始喽～！\n首先就是这段视频啦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
