{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_101_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_101_1083_041fuk", "source_sha256": "f05c0ec74729297f30d64ef9a02bd58080f5d18256579948f2cb86dbf5aeefaa", "ja": "ねえ、やよいちゃん。一緒に動くところなんだけど……\nあとでもう一回、合わせてもらってもいいかな？", "zh": "对了，弥生。我们一起行动的那部分……\n待会儿能再和我合练一次吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_101_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_101_1084_005yay", "source_sha256": "7f3be3f9d45118b5251407797dde9c03d553c26e2e38eba4e1854b2e02f9c8e3", "ja": "はい、わかりましたー！\nそれならエミリーちゃんも呼んで、みんなで……。", "zh": "好的，明白啦——！\n那就把艾米莉也叫来，大家一起……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_101_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_101_1085_onnanoko2", "source_sha256": "f19186b95d2e480e5b74c8d7a581d20effe983d4df111263d0520ac27d4f4bc9", "ja": "お姉さん達、真剣だね……。", "zh": "姐姐们都很认真呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_101_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_101_1086_p", "source_sha256": "7e39afaf36d8db7b3193b5ee2d6a60bec306567ea40a0b30f5ec7ab7d0febb97", "ja": "（一生懸命レッスンをするアイドル達の姿を見て、\n笑顔だった子供達の表情が変わっていく）", "zh": "（看到偶像们拼命练习的身影，原本面带笑容的孩子们，表情渐渐变了）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
