{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_101_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_101_1089_041fuk", "source_sha256": "ebb3487bfaf3dcaf1789dce1aaa66a5be9694357160b7fbe196206381af3d3ef", "ja": "エミリーちゃん、大丈夫だよ。\n突然のことで不安だと思うけど、私達がついてるよ！", "zh": "艾米莉，没事的。\n虽然事情发生得很突然，你可能会感到不安，但我们会陪着你的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_101_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_101_1090_027say", "source_sha256": "acf6207ca9021afd6aa030d366cefe883244fac83ec1fddf78baddb052cac163", "ja": "レッスンでは、ちゃんとできてたんだし。\n大丈夫、努力は絶対に裏切らないよ！", "zh": "练习时不是都做得很好嘛。\n没事的，努力绝对不会辜负你的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
