{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_101_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_101_1093_030iku", "source_sha256": "69ecb8e729da2d934728d35578bac6e9fde716b974d8e278d15ddc9a68215360", "ja": "エミリーさん、手かして？\n……はい、あくしゅ！", "zh": "艾米莉，借我一下手？\n……好，握手！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
